msgid "This deletes the stored key, all models using this provider and their task routes. Those tasks fall back to the default model, and if no default remains, they and other tasks without a route stop sending requests until you select one. Revoke the key at the provider to revoke access there."
msgstr "這會刪除儲存的密鑰、使用此供應商的模型及其任務路由。這些任務會退回至預設模型；若無預設模型，則這些與其他未設定路由的任務將停止傳送請求，直到你選取為止。請在供應商端撤銷密鑰以撤銷該處的存取權限。"

