#: lib/tuist_web/live/authentication_settings_live.html.heex:810
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How Tuist proves its identity to your provider. With a public key, you register Tuist's key with your provider and Tuist stores no secret."
msgstr "Tuist 如何向你的供應商證明身分。使用公開金鑰，你需在供應商處註冊 Tuist 的金鑰，而 Tuist 不會儲存任何機密。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/authentication_settings_live.html.heex:850
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In your app registration, open Certificates & secrets and upload each certificate below. Tuist signs with the first one; any other is the next key during a rotation."
msgstr "在你的應用程式註冊中，開啟「憑證與機密」並上傳下方的每張憑證。Tuist 會使用第一張進行簽署；其他憑證則作為金鑰輪換期間的下一個金鑰。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/authentication_settings_live.html.heex:821
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/authentication_settings_live.html.heex:870
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
